		(property "Description" "Barrier Y-cap, GND1 to GND2. 1nF Y1-rated, 400VAC, 14mm pitch -- the only intentional connection between the two grounds, giving GND2's ESD current a defined return path across the isolation barrier instead of forcing it through the ADuM4165 die. Not an owning-pin decoupling cap. Do NOT substitute a non-safety-rated (non-Y1) part."
